<Section title="Privacy information" description="What happens when you contact Mind Assembly or use an external participation link.">
  <h2>Website enquiries</h2>
  <p>The enquiry form sends your selected topic, message and optional reply email to Mind Assembly. Cloudflare Turnstile verifies submissions, and the website stores submitted enquiries in Cloudflare D1. Mind Assembly uses the submission to consider your enquiry and can reply if you supply an email address.</p>
  <h2>External services</h2>
  <p>WhatsApp, Google Forms, LinkedIn, Instagram and the externally hosted personality tool have their own privacy terms. Other WhatsApp group members may be able to see your phone number. The interest form asks about participation and can collect contact details you choose to share.</p>
  <h2>Questions about your information</h2>
  <p>Contact <a href="mailto:mindassembly2026@gmail.com?subject=Privacy%20enquiry">mindassembly2026@gmail.com</a> with questions about a submission or to request its deletion.</p>
</Section>
